<title>USA: Tosco Corp says reopens Trainer, Penn. refinery.</title>
<headline>Tosco Corp says reopens Trainer, Penn. refinery.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tosco Corp announced Thursday the restart of its Trainer, Penn. refinery, and projected the facility would reach full throughput of around 150,000 barrels per day (bpd) by early next week.</p>
<p>In a statement, Tosco said the refinery's refurbishment and turnaround maintenance program was completed several weeks ago ahead of schedule and under the original budget of $110 million.</p>
</text>
